  "title": "Heritage Financial Announces First Quarter 2026 Results and Declares Regular Cash Dividend of $0.24 Per Share",
  "summary": "Heritage Financial Corporation (Nasdaq GS: HFWA) (the \"Company,\" \"we,\" or \"us\"), the parent company of Heritage Bank (the \"Bank\"), today reported net income of $18.9 million for the first quarter of 2026, compared to $22.2 million for the fourth quarter of 2025 and $13.9 million for the first quarter of 2025. Diluted earnings per share were $0.48 for the first quarter of 2026, compared to $0.65 for the fourth quarter of 2025 and $0.40 for the first quarter of 2025. Adjusted diluted earnings per",
